==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|νυμφόληπτος||caught by nymphs, frenzied}}, from {{m|grc|νύμφη|}} + {{m|grc|λαμβάνω||I take}}.

===Noun===
